{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Last 7 Days is an open-world, zombie-themed, 3rd-person co-op survival game where 1\u20134 players try to survive together.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players try to survive by collecting loot on a vast map and traveling to different areas on horses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the days progress, zombie attacks become stronger, resources dwindle, the weather changes, and players enter a true struggle for survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfae KEY FEATURES</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2714 1\u20134 player Online Co-op &amp; LAN</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Team up with friends, share quests, and survive together.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2714 Open World Exploration</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Forests, villages, abandoned structures, and hidden loot areas.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2714 PvE Combat in a Zombie-Filled World</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More difficult, larger waves of zombies every night.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2714 Horseback Riding</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Travel quickly around the map, escape, chase, and reach loot points quickly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2714 Dark &amp; \u200b\u200bTense Atmosphere</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Things change at night. Light and intelligence become even more critical.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2714 Realistic Visuals (UE5)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >High-quality models, dark atmosphere, and detailed environments.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4082710?t=1763713981","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4082710?t=1763713981","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4082710/e1c879480153b1b44ffa594d8a12300b43b4cd05/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1763713981","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4082710/e1c879480153b1b44ffa594d8a12300b43b4cd05/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1763713981","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"LAN Co-op","id":48},{"description":"HDR available","id":61},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Last 7 Days is an open-world, zombie-themed, 3rd-person co-op survival game where 1\u20134 players try to survive together.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players try to survive by collecting loot on a vast map and traveling to different areas on horses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the days progress, zombie attacks become stronger, resources dwindle, the weather changes, and players enter a true struggle for survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfae KEY FEATURES</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2714 1\u20134 player Online Co-op &amp; LAN</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Team up with friends, share quests, and survive together.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2714 Open World Exploration</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Forests, villages, abandoned structures, and hidden loot areas.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2714 PvE Combat in a Zombie-Filled World</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More difficult, larger waves of zombies every night.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2714 Horseback Riding</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Travel quickly around the map, escape, chase, and reach loot points quickly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2714 Dark &amp; \u200b\u200bTense Atmosphere</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Things change at night. Light and intelligence become even more critical.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2714 Realistic Visuals (UE5)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >High-quality models, dark atmosphere, and detailed environments.</p>","developers":["IBRAHIM ARSLAN"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id